1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,817
11 Python list methods,

2
00:00:02,867 --> 00:00:05,100
explained with code.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,227
append() adds an item

4
00:00:08,277 --> 00:00:11,100
at the end of the list.

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,675
clear() removes

6
00:00:13,725 --> 00:00:17,100
every item from the list.

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,699
copy() makes a new list

8
00:00:20,749 --> 00:00:23,400
with the same items.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,533
count() tells how many times

10
00:00:27,583 --> 00:00:29,630
a value appears.

11
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:33,209
extend() adds all items

12
00:00:33,259 --> 00:00:35,630
from another list.

13
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:39,300
index() finds the position

14
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:41,630
of the first match.

15
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:44,709
insert() puts an item

16
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:48,010
at any position you choose.

17
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:51,207
pop() removes and returns

18
00:00:51,257 --> 00:00:54,010
the item at that position.

19
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:57,547
remove() deletes the first

20
00:00:57,597 --> 00:01:00,010
item with that value.

21
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:04,209
reverse() flips the order

22
00:01:04,259 --> 00:01:06,010
of the list.

23
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:09,088
sort() orders the list

24
00:01:09,138 --> 00:01:12,010
from smallest to largest.

25
00:01:12,610 --> 00:01:15,308
Save this cheat sheet

26
00:01:15,358 --> 00:01:18,890
and follow for more Python!
